WEBVTT

00:02.360 --> 00:05.320
How?
How is this happening?

00:05.320 --> 00:07.700
They're nothing but puny little humans.

00:07.700 --> 00:09.700
Our force should be greater than theirs.

00:09.700 --> 00:11.660
Yet, how could we be losing?!

00:12.080 --> 00:13.790
Phufun, explain!

00:13.790 --> 00:14.870
Yes, my Lord.

00:14.870 --> 00:20.120
According to the reports, there were
many traps planted in our troops' paths.

00:20.120 --> 00:23.250
We couldn't come near their troops.

00:23.250 --> 00:24.500
Traps?

00:24.500 --> 00:28.090
The Dark Army never had to deal
with that nonsense before.

00:28.090 --> 00:30.010
Then why can't we do the same?!

00:30.010 --> 00:31.430
About that...

00:31.430 --> 00:37.640
We'll just have to break through them
with sheer numbers!

00:37.640 --> 00:40.600
B-But where will we get such
sheer numbers?

00:40.600 --> 00:43.820
Figuring that out is your job!

00:45.570 --> 00:48.280
Think of a better plan next time.
Understand?

00:54.830 --> 00:59.160
With a commander who only knows how to
move forward, it's no wonder we're losing.

00:59.160 --> 01:02.750
Lord Gholl's plan to advance
was thoroughly planned.

01:03.190 --> 01:10.470
The core of that, the intelligence unit
also left with Uliminas.

01:10.470 --> 01:13.010
The officers' morale is also declining.

01:13.010 --> 01:16.640
At this rate, the Dark Army is bound to ruin.

01:16.640 --> 01:19.680
No, there is nothing to worry about.

01:19.680 --> 01:22.270
I have a plan.

01:22.980 --> 01:24.440
What plan?

01:26.070 --> 01:31.820
First, let's have a get-together
to boost morale!

01:46.670 --> 01:58.430
CHILLIN' IN ANOTHER WORLD
WITH LV2 SUPER CHEAT POWERS

03:03.960 --> 03:06.000
#11 STEAMY HOT SPRING TRIP PART ONE

03:06.000 --> 03:09.170
There is it, the first place!
Congratulations!

03:09.170 --> 03:10.800
I did it!

03:10.800 --> 03:13.380
I did it, Dear!

03:13.380 --> 03:15.470
Rys, your ears!

03:16.050 --> 03:19.510
The first prize is a trip
to the hot springs.

03:19.510 --> 03:22.430
A trip to the hot springs
alone with you!

03:23.100 --> 03:25.480
Right now, I am really happy.

03:25.480 --> 03:27.980
This is your prize, a family
accommodation voucher

03:27.980 --> 03:29.870
for a trip to the Kinosaki Hot Springs.

03:33.150 --> 03:34.740
For a family?

03:34.740 --> 03:35.900
Yes.

03:35.900 --> 03:41.700
You can take as few as three
or as many as fifteen people.

03:41.700 --> 03:44.500
Bringing friends is no problem.

03:46.660 --> 03:48.960
Can I swap this for another prize?

03:48.960 --> 03:50.080
Rys!

03:59.390 --> 04:02.890
Even though it's a secluded hot spring,
it's packed with people.

04:02.890 --> 04:05.390
They're wearing weird clothes.

04:05.390 --> 04:09.560
That's a yukata, the traditional attire
of an island nation in the East.

04:12.110 --> 04:16.990
Even though this is my first trip,
I can't be alone with you.

04:17.570 --> 04:19.029
It's all right, Rys.

04:19.029 --> 04:23.620
Let's take this chance for everyone
to get to know Ghozal and Uliminas.

04:25.790 --> 04:29.370
It seems there are seven hot springs here.

04:29.370 --> 04:32.340
Each spring has different benefits.

04:32.340 --> 04:34.170
Benefit, huh?

04:34.170 --> 04:38.130
Isn't it faster to rely on magic
rather than things like that?

04:38.130 --> 04:40.970
That's because hot springs
make you feel good.

04:41.400 --> 04:44.600
By the way, the benefits of
their hot springs are:

04:44.600 --> 04:49.440
revitalization, skin beauty, magic recovery,
and enhancing fertility...

04:50.650 --> 04:51.900
Fertility?

04:57.400 --> 05:00.950
I'm glad that we're able to come here.

05:00.950 --> 05:03.120
What's with you suddenly?

05:05.830 --> 05:09.040
Welcome to the Kinosaki Hot Springs!

05:09.540 --> 05:12.580
Thank you for making the long trip here.

05:12.580 --> 05:16.000
Please use our hot springs
to relax and heal your fatigue.

05:16.000 --> 05:19.220
Thank you so much.
I'm looking forward to it.

05:19.220 --> 05:22.590
Then, please sign your name there first.

05:22.990 --> 05:24.180
Yes.

05:24.180 --> 05:27.600
We have prepared yukatas for you.

05:27.600 --> 05:30.810
You can change clothes
in the room over there.

05:31.810 --> 05:33.520
Hey, you there.

05:33.520 --> 05:36.320
Yes? Is there anything I can help with?

05:36.320 --> 05:39.860
Where's the spring to enhance fertility?

05:40.530 --> 05:43.740
Are you searching for the Yanagi Spring?

05:43.740 --> 05:47.700
That's outdoor, and this guide will
help you to take you there.

05:49.890 --> 05:50.830
Good luck.

05:54.920 --> 05:57.630
They said the changing room
is here, right?

06:01.920 --> 06:02.880
I'm sorry.

06:05.720 --> 06:07.140
Please wait.

06:07.140 --> 06:08.930
We're fine here, please go ahead.

06:08.930 --> 06:12.770
Okay. Sorry for bumping into you.

06:14.270 --> 06:17.230
Hey! Why are you letting her
off the hook?

06:17.230 --> 06:20.820
That insignificant lifeform
dared to bump into me!

06:20.820 --> 06:26.200
Lord Yuigarde, did you forget why
we are here in human form?

06:26.660 --> 06:32.830
We're here to boost morale and deepen the bond
among officers after our recent defeat.

06:33.290 --> 06:36.040
We can't do that if you cause
a disturbance here.

06:37.500 --> 06:38.960
What a pain.

06:38.960 --> 06:41.090
Why do we need to do this?

06:41.090 --> 06:44.970
It's nice to be nude
in a relaxed environment.

06:44.970 --> 06:46.840
I'm going to stretch my wings today.

06:47.210 --> 06:50.100
I heard there is a hot spring
that is good for the skin.

06:50.100 --> 06:52.310
I wonder if it really works.

06:52.310 --> 06:55.020
I'm going to drink as much as I can.

06:55.020 --> 07:01.820
Everyone, please keep the necklace close
to your skin to suppress your Malicium.

07:06.200 --> 07:09.280
What are they doing here?

07:09.280 --> 07:12.580
The officers of the Dark Army are here?

07:12.580 --> 07:16.670
Did they need something like this
during my leadership?

07:17.330 --> 07:20.210
They might be, but you,
the Dark One shouldn't—

07:21.920 --> 07:23.710
Yeah, you should too.

07:24.070 --> 07:26.380
Listen, you two...

07:26.380 --> 07:29.050
Don't let them see you, okay?

07:29.720 --> 07:33.470
Why sneak around?
A greeting would be okay, right?

07:33.470 --> 07:37.400
There's no way your meeting with
Yuigarde would end up fine!

07:37.790 --> 07:43.570
If you do something that's going to interrupt
my trip with my dear, I won't forgive you.

07:45.700 --> 07:47.950
Wow! This is so spacious!

07:48.370 --> 07:50.490
We take off the shoes
before entering, right?

07:50.490 --> 07:53.410
So these are tatami?
What a mysterious smell.

07:53.910 --> 07:56.620
- What an odd feeling!
- This is the girl's room.

07:59.250 --> 08:02.920
My Dear and I will be in another room.

08:03.800 --> 08:06.630
Ghozal, you can take another room too.

08:06.630 --> 08:09.260
I'm fine to sleep here with everyone.

08:09.260 --> 08:11.470
Of course you can't!

08:11.930 --> 08:13.250
Now, now.

08:13.250 --> 08:16.140
We've come all the way here
through Sir Flio's kindness,

08:16.140 --> 08:18.850
so let's all get along and enjoy
this trip to the fullest!

08:19.350 --> 08:20.810
Y-Yeah...

08:20.810 --> 08:25.360
I want to eat hot spring Manju
and hot spring eggs before dinner.

08:25.940 --> 08:28.780
I want to try shooting games.

08:28.780 --> 08:29.910
What about you, Byleri?

08:29.910 --> 08:35.409
I have some places
that I want to go alone.

08:36.580 --> 08:38.289
And you, Balirossa?

08:38.289 --> 08:40.000
Let's see...

08:43.789 --> 08:45.460
I will...

08:46.340 --> 08:48.340
Dear, let's soak in!

08:49.010 --> 08:51.680
Let's go to the Yanagi Spring now!

08:51.680 --> 08:53.720
Sure.

08:53.720 --> 08:56.270
Then, I will accompany both of you.

08:56.270 --> 09:00.600
Hiya, don't interrupt us today!

09:01.010 --> 09:01.940
But...

09:01.940 --> 09:04.400
Understand?

09:04.400 --> 09:06.480
Yes, I understand.

09:06.890 --> 09:10.200
Today is the day to make
a baby with my Dear!

09:10.570 --> 09:14.160
It seems like everyone has a place
they want to go.

09:14.160 --> 09:16.660
Let's have some free time
until dinner time.

09:17.050 --> 09:18.500
I agree!

09:18.500 --> 09:22.370
Now, let's go there quickly!

09:22.370 --> 09:23.960
Uh, okay.

09:25.540 --> 09:26.650
Well, then...

09:33.590 --> 09:36.640
It's been a while, Hiya the Djinn.

09:36.640 --> 09:40.270
I thought you forgot about me.

09:40.890 --> 09:43.310
Of course not.

09:43.310 --> 09:45.980
Since this is my psyche world.

09:46.520 --> 09:50.990
Your soul will always be with me.

09:52.110 --> 09:54.450
So, what do you want?

09:54.450 --> 09:59.450
The truth is, I want you to
accompany me on a practice.

09:59.450 --> 10:01.120
Huh? Practice?

10:04.630 --> 10:06.540
What the heck is this?!

10:06.960 --> 10:15.260
I got curious about mating after I saw
The Exalted One and his Lady did it.

10:15.260 --> 10:16.760
Huh?!

10:17.110 --> 10:19.890
I wanted to watch the whole process.

10:19.890 --> 10:24.140
But since that is not possible,
so I want to learn it in action.

10:24.140 --> 10:26.150
How can you get that conclusion?!

10:27.480 --> 10:29.480
I mean, look...

10:29.480 --> 10:31.690
You only do this with someone you like!

10:32.650 --> 10:33.780
Someone I like?

10:33.780 --> 10:37.370
Besides, I'm a woman!
And so are you!

10:37.370 --> 10:39.370
Just copying those two wouldn't work!

10:39.790 --> 10:43.750
I am the djinn who commands
primordial light and darkness.

10:43.750 --> 10:47.170
My very being transcends gender.

10:50.090 --> 10:51.590
And in the first place,

10:51.590 --> 10:59.640
people like you whose greed knows
no bounds have always been my type.

10:59.640 --> 11:03.230
T-That's not how it works!

11:04.600 --> 11:09.440
I get kicked out of
my own psyche world.

11:09.860 --> 11:15.400
I guess the most important thing is
to get the partner's acceptance first.

11:16.030 --> 11:18.740
But how?

11:19.620 --> 11:22.120
This is it! The Yanagi Spring.

11:22.500 --> 11:23.790
Let's go inside then.

11:23.790 --> 11:24.580
Let's!

11:25.000 --> 11:28.540
After we're done soaking in this spring,

11:29.000 --> 11:32.880
please pamper me a lot, okay?

11:33.840 --> 11:35.510
I-I will do my best.

11:36.010 --> 11:39.600
Wait, that's the women's bath!

11:47.650 --> 11:51.020
It's been a while since
I've been able to relax like this.

11:51.450 --> 11:53.730
This might be the first
since I came here.

11:54.860 --> 11:57.450
My dear, are you there?

11:59.620 --> 12:01.330
Yeah, I'm here.

12:03.450 --> 12:05.160
The baths are right across each other.

12:05.560 --> 12:07.160
You're right.

12:07.830 --> 12:09.120
You know, Rys.

12:09.120 --> 12:10.420
Yes?

12:10.420 --> 12:13.000
We still haven't done our honeymoon.

12:13.000 --> 12:16.090
Let's plan another trip
for just the two of us later.

12:16.670 --> 12:18.050
I'm so happy!

12:19.510 --> 12:24.390
I was disappointed that
we couldn't go together earlier.

12:24.390 --> 12:28.440
Doing something we shouldn't be
doing behind our backs like this,

12:29.100 --> 12:30.730
it's so exciting.

12:31.860 --> 12:34.780
I feel like I'm warm enough now.

12:34.780 --> 12:36.440
I'm going out first.

12:36.440 --> 12:40.780
Huh?! Wait for me, Dear!

12:42.240 --> 12:47.790
I came here even after
turning down their offer.

12:48.410 --> 12:50.920
To this treasure room...

12:50.920 --> 12:52.540
Gulp...

12:52.540 --> 12:54.230
Here goes.

12:56.130 --> 12:58.420
So you are interested in this place too?

12:58.740 --> 13:05.890
According to my search, this place showcases
sexual customs across the ages.

13:06.350 --> 13:11.480
I have come here to learn how to get
my partner to accept me.

13:11.480 --> 13:13.940
There's no way I would!

13:13.940 --> 13:16.360
We will not know unless we come in.

13:16.360 --> 13:19.360
Who are you talking to?

13:20.200 --> 13:21.660
Do not mind me.

13:21.660 --> 13:24.950
Come on, let us enjoy this
to the fullest.

13:24.950 --> 13:28.660
I'm not mentally prepared yet!

13:36.500 --> 13:39.210
Drinking in the middle of the day
is the best!

13:39.580 --> 13:40.630
This is tasty.

13:40.630 --> 13:42.680
I'm going to buy it for Sybe.

13:42.680 --> 13:45.050
By the way, Balirossa.

13:45.420 --> 13:48.520
Don't just stare at Ghozal
passionately like that.

13:48.520 --> 13:51.190
If you like him, just go get him.

13:51.190 --> 13:55.060
Huh?! I'm just keeping an eye
on those two!

13:55.060 --> 13:58.190
Hey, Ghozal!
Are you having a good time?

13:58.190 --> 13:59.440
Blossom, stop it!

13:59.440 --> 14:01.950
Blossom and Balirossa.

14:01.950 --> 14:05.700
It's nice to have a different,
more relaxed atmosphere.

14:06.450 --> 14:10.620
You look lovely too
in that yukata, Balirossa.

14:10.620 --> 14:11.660
Huh?

14:12.080 --> 14:14.370
Stop flirting!

14:14.370 --> 14:16.840
That's unbecoming for
a former Dark One!

14:19.300 --> 14:22.880
Isn't that fine?
Anyway, let's drink together!

14:23.310 --> 14:25.090
Sure, let's do it.

14:35.020 --> 14:37.440
What's with this disgusting food?

14:37.840 --> 14:41.150
So humans have been eating these
all the time?

14:41.150 --> 14:44.700
Just as you say, this is so disgusting.

14:44.700 --> 14:46.620
This is not a food.

14:47.030 --> 14:49.330
So fresh and delicious.

14:49.330 --> 14:50.580
We want seconds!

14:50.580 --> 14:53.210
Which one of you knows how to party?

14:53.550 --> 14:55.170
Let's liven things up!

14:55.570 --> 14:58.540
Then, I will start first.

15:03.220 --> 15:04.970
What's with that dance of yours?!

15:04.970 --> 15:08.050
Show me something better than that!

15:09.010 --> 15:11.100
Leave it to us!

15:13.310 --> 15:14.980
Look there!

15:16.310 --> 15:17.980
Look there!

15:20.940 --> 15:22.780
Good. Show me more!

15:22.780 --> 15:24.570
That hurts!

15:24.570 --> 15:26.740
You did it first!

15:26.740 --> 15:27.910
What's with you, bastard?

15:27.910 --> 15:29.030
You want to pick a fight?

15:29.030 --> 15:30.660
Fine, let's do it!

15:32.290 --> 15:36.170
Finally, we made it out from
the demon territory.

15:36.540 --> 15:40.170
They won't chase us here.

15:40.170 --> 15:44.090
I want to get in the hot spring
and eat something good.

15:44.090 --> 15:46.380
You can eat as much as you want.

15:46.930 --> 15:51.010
By selling this demon's treasure,
we can make a lot of money.

15:51.010 --> 15:53.640
We have totally become thieves, aren't we?

15:53.640 --> 15:54.850
What are you saying?!

15:54.850 --> 15:59.020
We were almost killed.
This much compensation is natural.

16:03.190 --> 16:05.650
Are you all right, Sir Hero?

16:09.660 --> 16:11.990
How dare you!

16:12.330 --> 16:15.580
It's your own fault for getting
blown off that easily!

16:15.580 --> 16:18.170
Damn you!

16:20.460 --> 16:24.170
What are you two doing?

16:24.170 --> 16:25.380
Isn't that person...

16:25.920 --> 16:29.510
Then, they must be...

16:29.510 --> 16:31.220
Demons!

16:39.350 --> 16:41.270
Sir Hero!

16:42.610 --> 16:43.690
Wait, those two...

16:51.320 --> 16:53.740
Again?!

16:56.870 --> 16:59.040
You drink too much.

16:59.710 --> 17:01.790
Mind your own business.

17:02.880 --> 17:07.550
Uliminas, do you wish for Ghozal
to be the Dark One again?

17:07.550 --> 17:08.800
Of course.

17:09.150 --> 17:11.130
The demon society is
based on one's strength.

17:11.550 --> 17:19.730
No one else possesses great strength
yet cares about demons like him.

17:19.730 --> 17:26.569
Someone who was feared and so noble
isn't suited to walk around like a human.

17:28.280 --> 17:33.030
So that's why you won't call him Ghozal.

17:33.030 --> 17:35.530
Is there something funny?

17:35.530 --> 17:42.460
You always call him "former Dark One"
or "you" since you came to our house.

17:42.460 --> 17:45.880
It was kind of childish.

17:45.880 --> 17:48.460
Huh? Are you making fun of me?!

17:49.760 --> 17:56.760
You left the Dark Army to follow him,
I'm sure it wasn't an easy decision.

17:56.760 --> 17:59.310
But now I get it.

17:59.890 --> 18:02.270
You love Ghozal, don't you?

18:04.730 --> 18:07.440
- Huh?!
- The inn!

18:17.030 --> 18:19.490
Everyone, stay calm and don't run!

18:19.490 --> 18:21.790
What's happening?

18:21.790 --> 18:23.710
Please evacuate first!

18:23.710 --> 18:27.210
These magical talismans will
lead you on the safe routes!

18:28.570 --> 18:30.460
Ma'am, behind you!

18:36.350 --> 18:38.430
What is this?

18:42.230 --> 18:44.230
I'm glad I noticed that earlier.

18:44.230 --> 18:46.360
Are you okay, Dear?

18:46.360 --> 18:51.570
Yeah! But I can't figure out what's
going on at the inn from here.

18:51.570 --> 18:54.990
Rys, could you check what's
happening there for me?

18:54.990 --> 18:55.990
Yes!

18:56.370 --> 18:57.990
Leave it to me!

18:57.990 --> 19:01.120
Wait! Put some clothes on first!

19:02.580 --> 19:05.710
The collapse stopped?

19:05.710 --> 19:08.590
Yeah. It must be Sir Flio.

19:08.590 --> 19:12.090
But what's with that
big black monster over there?

19:12.520 --> 19:15.050
That's concentrated Malicium.

19:15.050 --> 19:18.510
Malicium? Then there are demons here?

19:18.510 --> 19:23.140
Actually, we saw the current Dark One,
Yuigarde, at the inn earlier.

19:23.140 --> 19:26.190
I'm sure they are the ones behind this.

19:29.110 --> 19:34.650
I can't see it clearly, but I think that's
a gem that boosts Malicium absorption.

19:34.650 --> 19:37.280
It can strengthen the demon who wears it,

19:37.280 --> 19:40.450
but other than demons,
they will go berserk.

19:40.450 --> 19:43.870
Anyway, we've got to get
everyone out of the inn.

19:43.870 --> 19:44.910
Yeah!

19:44.910 --> 19:48.290
Wait! It won't change anything
if you go there!

19:48.290 --> 19:49.790
Just evacuate!

19:50.210 --> 19:54.210
Flio can handle this on his own.

19:54.210 --> 19:56.760
Just like Uliminas says,
the rest of you need to—

19:56.760 --> 19:57.720
Don't be ridiculous.

19:58.180 --> 20:00.970
Are you intending to have
Sir Flio handle this alone?

20:01.560 --> 20:08.480
He has been caught in the conflict between
humans and demons and has suffered a lot.

20:09.310 --> 20:14.530
Even so, he uses his power for everyone.

20:15.280 --> 20:19.240
There's no way we can just stand by,
even if we are weak!

20:19.910 --> 20:25.040
We want to be with him because
we want to help him, even just a little!

20:26.580 --> 20:29.880
We were former knights too.

20:29.880 --> 20:33.300
We only help what we can do.

20:33.750 --> 20:34.670
Let's go.

20:37.340 --> 20:39.140
There goes the idiots.

20:39.970 --> 20:42.720
They don't even know their own strength.

20:44.010 --> 20:49.690
Flio doesn't keep those girls around
to protect them.

20:50.980 --> 20:54.070
Rys told us not to cause a scene,

20:54.510 --> 20:57.760
but this isn't the time
to stay hidden anymore.

20:58.530 --> 21:02.120
What do you say, Uliminas?
Do you want to get scolded together?

21:04.120 --> 21:09.330
He never asked for opinions until now.

21:10.080 --> 21:12.570
No fair.

21:13.470 --> 21:18.300
Helping the humans?
You've failed as a Dark One.

21:18.300 --> 21:21.890
Right now, I'm just a normal person.

21:21.890 --> 21:25.260
Fighting to protect our vacation.

21:25.690 --> 21:28.140
Once this is over,
I'm hitting the hot springs.

21:31.310 --> 21:33.730
Rys? You're here too?

21:33.730 --> 21:35.360
Obviously!

21:35.360 --> 21:38.440
Didn't I say I'd rip anyone
who interrupted our vacation?

21:38.440 --> 21:41.030
Isn't that...

21:41.030 --> 21:42.160
Lord Gholl!

21:42.160 --> 21:43.620
What?!

21:43.620 --> 21:45.200
Out of my way!

21:48.950 --> 21:52.420
Never thought I'd see you here, Gholl.

21:54.130 --> 21:57.380
I was bored by this hot spring,
or whatever it is.

21:57.380 --> 22:00.050
But this is getting exciting now.

22:06.600 --> 22:09.930
Now, let's have a festival!

23:40.650 --> 23:42.780
This yukata is an elegant
piece of clothing.

23:42.780 --> 23:46.610
